WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:34.840
Aknadin gained Zorc's power to transform into Great Shadow Magus.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:38.120
He wants his son Seto to become the Pharaoh.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:41.780
Seto, don't listen to him!

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:46.020
We must save this kingdom and its people from Zorc!

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:51.200
Meanwhile, my partner arrived at the location with my name.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.960
Bakura should've been gone, but he's back!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:00.970
Countdown to the Evil God's Resurrection

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:06.740
I'm back, Pharaoh!

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:08.330
Impossible!

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.230
Is he immortal?

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.360
Bakura…

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:15.000
Enough talk, Great Shadow Magus.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.280
No one wants to hear you complain.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:22.520
The more powerful my game piece, the more annoying they are.

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:23.800
You're...

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.640
Don't be so surprised.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:31.240
You yourself know Zorc's power.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:36.180
That same power resurrected me.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:40.100
Zorc is that powerful?

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:46.040
Great Shadow Magus, you shouldn't have time to complain.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:49.480
You have more important things to do.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.410
For him.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.060
Seto…

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:08.610
For Seto?

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:13.470
Yes.  You must give him Blue-Eyes's power.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:15.850
Blue-Eyes?

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:22.220
He has a strong bond with the girl carrying the white dragon's power.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:25.390
Fate is cruel.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.450
Kisara…

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.710
What?  Her?

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.620
You know her, Shada?

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:39.070
Yes.  We found a foreigner with great power, and Seto hid her in the palace.

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:42.900
What is it, Seto?

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:50.170
Her Heka is too powerful to measure!

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:54.890
Her Heka was incredibly powerful.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:58.700
It may rival the gods.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:00.890
And you'll take that power?

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:05.820
Exactly!  Seto will use that power to serve Zorc.

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:11.280
If he does, as you wish, I'll make your son the next Pharaoh.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:16.770
A Pharaoh that's stronger than any Pharaoh that came before.

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:20.700
You better keep your promise.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:25.140
Seto, my son.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:30.450
Join me to become the new Pharaoh and get our glory!

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.030
I…

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:33.960
Wait, Aknadin!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.660
Did you forget I was here?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.570
Diabound!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.070
Diabound!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:54.500
Impossible!  Diabound’s tablet was destroyed!

00:04:54.500 --> 00:05:01.440
Now that the Millennium Items are together, the seal to the next world is weak.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:07.840
The dark power from that world has resurrected Diabound with greater strength!

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.910
Seto, become the Pharaoh.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.820
Acquire power that's greater than the gods!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:19.200
No, Seto!  Don't join him!

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:25.860
Seto, we’re both priests who’ve sworn to serve the Pharaoh.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.800
Don't betray him!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.120
Open your eyes, Seto!

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:35.660
Don't get possessed by evil, like Aknadin did!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.260
Seto, don’t join him!

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.720
Don’t interfere!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:50.900
Seto!

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:53.400
Wait!

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:59.450
You'll all stay here.

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:00.450
Bakura!

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:05.610
Let's keep playing.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:08.740
What?

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.850
The tablet…

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:25.170
You can’t reach the tablet until the sand in the hourglass runs out.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.540
Bakura!

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:36.980
If we sit and wait, Zorc will eventually resurrect.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:42.160
During this time, I'll grant Aknadin’s wish.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:47.310
Oh, I haven’t forgotten about you either.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:49.020
What are you going to do?

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:52.460
Let me begin.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.230
What's this?

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:11.410
Let's play tag.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:21.720
Where am I?

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.800
What's this?

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.530
Oh, I remember.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:51.110
What?

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:03.310
Those occult items are creating this illusion.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:05.980
What happened to me back then?

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:07.300
Hurry up!

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:08.590
Wait for me!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:10.930
You're too slow!

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:13.820
Hurry up!

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.260
Wait up!

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.830
Is this world an illusion…

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:28.860
...or is it me?

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:30.800
Seto!

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:37.360
Seto?

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:44.170
No, you're not him.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:46.340
You're...

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:56.140
You were in my vision.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:09:00.090
How strange...  You seem the same as Seto.

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:02.240
What do you know?

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.550
Where am I?

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:06.030
Explain what's going on!

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:09.040
A great catastrophe is coming.

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.940
If nothing is done, everything will be destroyed.

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.870
What?

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:19.600
I must leave.  But I sense we’ll meet again.

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:29.410
Bakura, where are they?

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.640
Be patient.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:33.860
See?  You can see them now.

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:40.930
Master!  Prince!  Where are you?

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.910
Are you okay, Shimon?

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:47.660
Yes.  But where are we?

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:53.310
What did you do?

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:56.860
It's no fun to just sit around.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:01.790
I’ll show you a fraction of the dark power that’s about to resurrect.

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:03.580
You're welcome.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:05.420
You…

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.850
Here I go.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:20.700
Where did everyone go?

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.510
What?

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:55.000
Bobasa must have appeared just so he could bring us here.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:58.240
Let’s go, Yugi.

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:02.480
My other self’s name is inside.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:06.340
Just wait.  I promise to find your name.

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:15.260
Mahad, where are the others?

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:17.200
I don't see them nearby.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.140
I see.  I just hope they're safe.

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:26.140
Bakura divided us so that he can defeat us one at a time.

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:29.400
He's being helped by some great power.

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:33.820
We must rejoin the others quickly and find Seto.

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:40.240
Kaiba, I mean, Seto met someone who has Blue-Eyes.

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:45.000
Just like how I met Mahad, who will become Dark Magician.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.520
What's wrong?

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.690
That's...

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:00.270
What is that?

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.670
Oh no!

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:13.710
Isis…

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:16.540
Karim, you're awake.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.160
Don’t worry about me.

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:20.240
Protect the Pharaoh.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:23.380
I can’t just leave you.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:28.320
I no longer have the Ba to summon a Ka.

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:33.590
Without the Millennium Scale, I'm only a burden.

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:34.500
Karim…

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:45.750
Entertain me.

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:50.510
Magical Shockwave!

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.450
Pharaoh!

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.790
Hasan!  Mahad!

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.450
Rapid Fire Magic!

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:16.100
You think you can survive with those attacks?

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.040
Bakura…

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:25.060
I stole some of Kaiba’s Ba, so I still have energy in reserve.

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:27.220
What will you do, Pharaoh?

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:32.370
While we talk, the sand is falling in the hourglass.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:36.890
The more time I waste, the more likely I'll lose.

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:38.840
I should retreat for now.

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:43.830
Do you think you can keep running from my Ka?

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:54.890
And don't forget: If an NPC dies, they can't resurrect like I did.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:08.920
Mana!

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:11.790
Keep running, girl.

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:13.860
If you don't want to be crushed.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:19.300
I refuse to lose!

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:22.080
Mana…

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:24.670
She's sharp.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.670
But how long will you last?

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:30.460
What will you do, Pharaoh?

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:35.520
Will you abandon the priests and return to the shrine to search for the tablet?

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.890
Will you save those useless people?

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:41.380
Or go after Seto and the Great Shadow Magus?

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:45.040
I like that look on your face.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:46.990
Keep struggling.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.500
Two-Headed Jackal Warrior!

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:04.740
Are you okay, Shada?

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:08.900
Yes.  But more importantly, we must search for the Pharaoh.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.660
Yes.  I hope he's okay.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.140
They don’t give up.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.820
You have some fine pawns.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.760
Pawns?

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:22.770
They're nothing more than game pieces.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.760
If they're useful - good.

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:26.700
If not - throw them away.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:31.150
You're wrong!  They're my friends!

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:36.380
How can you care so much when you don’t have the Pharaoh's memories?

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:42.590
They're only alive inside this game.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:47.880
In reality, they've been buried in sand long ago.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.260
Along with your memories.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:54.390
It's true I don’t remember the time I spent with them.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:16:01.840
I don't remember what we spoke of or what we wanted to do.

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:07.490
Spiria!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.210
However...

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.190
Isis...

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:33.610
Two-Headed Jackal Warrior!

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:34.740
Isis!

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:36.800
Isis!

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:37.740
Are you okay?

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.740
Shada!  Shimon!

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:41.840
How's Karim?

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.050
Shada, where’s the Pharaoh?

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:52.430
Karim, leave this to us.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.600
Shada.

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:57.170
Shada, take my Ba.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:58.330
Karim!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.340
I'll give you my remaining power.

00:17:01.340 --> 00:17:03.500
Use it to protect the Pharaoh.

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:06.170
I promise.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:26.360
Karim, I've received your life.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:37.540
Go, Two-Headed Jackal Warrior!

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.640
Shada!

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:53.910
Pharaoh!

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.030
Pharaoh…

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:00.880
Please stop Seto.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:05.460
Don’t let him be like Aknadin.

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:08.100
Yes, I know.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:14.000
Pharaoh, I'm glad I was able to serve you.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.330
Karim!

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:24.670
Karim!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.460
Karim…

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:34.960
Pharaoh?

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.490
I won't let anyone else die!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:45.330
Hasan, stay here and protect them.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.870
I’ll go after Seto.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:47.800
But…

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:51.710
They’re important to me.

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:52.710
Pharaoh…

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:56.620
Understood.  If that is your wish, Pharaoh.

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.210
Thank you.

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:05.760
Pharaoh...

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.330
We can touch the walls.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:17.710
This must be the place Grandpa spoke of - where the Millennium Puzzle was kept.

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:19.260
What?

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:21.280
The Millennium Puzzle was here?

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:23.260
Let's hurry!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:26.420
Jonouchi!  You can't just run around!

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:33.010
Grandpa said this place was full of traps.

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:35.030
Speak up sooner!

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:39.240
Grandpa must've told you how to make it through.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:42.620
Yeah.  If things haven't changed.

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:47.180
This is inside a tomb?

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:51.670
Traps to protect what’s hidden ahead from graverobbers.

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:54.100
So how do we get through?

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:58.370
Those who raid the great Pharaoh's realm will be punished.

00:19:58.370 --> 00:20:01.020
In ancient Egypt, Pharaohs are gods.

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:06.490
Statues offered to the Pharaoh must have their left foot forward.

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:11.860
They offer their heart on the left side of their body, symbolizing absolute obedience.

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:13.280
Which means…

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:15.800
We must walk with our left foot forward.

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:18.660
Oh.  That's easy!

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:25.930
This is our second test.

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:27.780
What do we do here?

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:31.700
You shall be judged by the Ka dwelling in the tablets.

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:34.520
Monsters will devour the souls of the fearful.

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:37.490
The brave shall be shown the way.

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:39.700
Does that mean...

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:43.570
If we’re even a little scared, monsters will eat us?

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:47.070
Yugi!

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:48.160
Be careful!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.490
My other self’s name is just ahead.

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:57.300
If I can find that name and save my other self, I'm not afraid.

00:20:57.300 --> 00:20:58.560
Yugi…

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:01.210
Okay!  I won't be scared either!

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:01.980
Right!

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:15.640
The box containing the Millennium Puzzle used to be here.

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:17.730
But there’s nothing here.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:21.990
Where's the other Yugi's name?

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:26.300
There's nothing resembling it on this wall.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:27.590
Yugi...

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:32.530
There must be a room ahead that even my Grandpa couldn't reach.

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:35.360
Even so, Yugi...

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:41.570
What’s this?

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:44.160
It's opening.

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:15.490
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:31.210
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:37.050
Without a goal in mind

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:45.620
We just step towards our dream

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:51.260
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:59.730
Your eye will find it

00:23:00.090 --> 00:23:05.540
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:13.680
Will touch your soul

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:16.940
In a duel

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:32.610
We reached the altar in the tomb, but the Pharaoh's name isn't here.

00:23:32.610 --> 00:23:36.560
That's when the wall opened, revealing a hidden room.

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.250
The name must be in there!

00:23:39.250 --> 00:23:44.170
But Honda, you've been acting weird.

00:23:44.170 --> 00:23:50.910
Meanwhile, can the Pharaoh save Seto from the Great Shadow Magus?

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:52.940
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
White Dragon

00:23:52.940 --> 00:23:54.420
Stay tuned!
